#, no-wrap
msgid "Stefan Zipproth"
msgstr "Stefan Zipproth"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Image src={stefan} alt=\"Stefan Zipproth\" width={150} />\n"
msgstr "<Image src={stefan} alt=\"Stefan Zipproth\" width={150} />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"Stefan Zipproth is the lead developer and creator of Ditana. A software "
"developer from St. Ursen, Switzerland, with a background in embedded systems "
"and cross-platform development. He has worked in industries ranging from RF "
"measurement and classical image processing to AI-powered medical imaging. "
"Since 2023, he has focused on developing and refining products for the Linux "
"ecosystem. A broader overview of his work — spanning systems architecture, "
"high-performance C++, and knowledge representation — is available on his "
"[personal portfolio](https://zipproth.ch)."
msgstr ""
"Stefan Zipproth è il sviluppader principal ed il creader da Ditana. El è "
"sviluppader da software da St. Ursen, Svizra, cun experientscha en sistems "
"integrads ed en il svilup per pliras plattafurmas. El ha lavurà en branschas "
"che van da la mesiraziun d’auta frequenza e da l’elavuraziun classica da "
"maletgs fin a la diagnostica medicinala cun maletgs sustegnida da l’IA. Dapi "
"il 2023 sa concentrescha el sin il svilup ed il perfecziunament da products "
"per l’ecosistem Linux. Ina survista pli vasta da sia lavur – che cumpiglia "
"l’architectura da sistems, C++ d’auta prestaziun e la represchentaziun da "
"savida – è disponibla en ses [portfolio persunal](https://zipproth.ch)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"Through **acrion innovations GmbH**, Stefan manages the financial side of "
"Ditana while focusing solely on its development as a solo developer. This "
"structure ensures transparent stewardship of resources for the community-"
"driven project."
msgstr ""
"Tras **acrion innovations GmbH** administrescha Stefan la part finanziala da "
"Ditana, entant ch’el sa concentrescha sco sviluppader che lavura sulet "
"exclusivamain sin ses svilup. Questa structura garantescha ina "
"administraziun transparenta da las resursas per il project purtà da la "
"communitad."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thomas Zipproth"
msgstr "Thomas Zipproth"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Image src={thomas} alt=\"Thomas Zipproth\" width={150} />\n"
msgstr "<Image src={thomas} alt=\"Thomas Zipproth\" width={150} />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"Thomas Zipproth is an experienced software developer from Mindelheim, "
"Germany, with deep expertise in image processing — particularly in document "
"scanning and recognition technologies. He has spent his career working on "
"high-precision systems for automated data extraction and provides valuable "
"testing support and feedback for Ditana, helping refine its usability and "
"reliability."
msgstr ""
"Thomas Zipproth è in sviluppader da software cun blera experientscha da "
"Mindelheim, Germania, cun enconuschientschas profundas en l’elavuraziun da "
"maletgs – surtut en las tecnologias per scannar e renconuscher documents. "
"Durant sia carriera ha el lavurà vi da sistems d’auta precisiun per "
"l’extracziun automatisada da datas, e cun ses tests e ses resuns prezius "
"sustegna el Ditana e gida a meglierar la facilitad da diever e la "
"reliabilitad da Ditana."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
#, no-wrap
msgid "Acknowledgements"
msgstr "Engraziaments"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"Ditana would not be what it is without the contributions of others. Special "
"thanks to:"
msgstr ""
"Senza las contribuziuns d’autras persunas na fiss Ditana betg quai ch’ella "
"è. In grond engraziament va a:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"**Alexey Melezhik** for the [Sparrow6](https://github.com/melezhik/Sparrow6) "
"work that replaced Ansible in 0.9.3 and for ongoing collaboration on test "
"infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"**Alexey Melezhik** per la lavur vi da [Sparrow6](https://github.com/"
"melezhik/Sparrow6) che ha remplazzà Ansible en la versiun 0.9.3 e per la "
"collavuraziun cuntinuanta vi da l’infrastructura da test."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"**Ralf Hersel** of [gnulinux.ch](https://gnulinux.ch) for the early coverage "
"and the [podcast interview](https://gnulinux.ch/ciw119-podcast) that "
"introduced Ditana to a wider Swiss/German-speaking audience."
msgstr ""
"**Ralf Hersel** da [gnulinux.ch](https://gnulinux.ch) per ils emprims "
"rapports e per l’[intervista da podcast](https://gnulinux.ch/ciw119-podcast) "
"che ha preschentà Ditana ad in public pli vast en Svizra ed en il mund da "
"lingua tudestga."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"Everyone who has filed an issue, sent feedback, or simply tried Ditana and "
"shared what worked or didn't."
msgstr ""
"Tut las persunas che han avert in issue, tramess in resun u simplamain "
"empruvà Ditana e communitgà tge che ha funcziunà e tge betg."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/who-we-are.mdx
msgid ""
"If you want to reach us: [support@ditana.org](mailto:support@ditana.org) for "
"anything at all, the [Discord channel](https://discord.gg/RgcdumdE9J) for a "
"conversation, and the issue trackers for [the installer](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-installer/issues), [the configuration](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-config/issues) and [the package pipeline](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-build/issues) when you have something specific."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus vulais ans contactar: [support@ditana.org]"
"(mailto:support@ditana.org) per tut e mintga chaussa, il [chanal da Discord]"
"(https://discord.gg/RgcdumdE9J) per ina discussiun e las glistas dals issues "
"per [l’installatur](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues), [la "
"configuraziun](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-config/issues) e [la "
"pipeline da pachets](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build/issues), sche "
"Vus avais insatge concret."
